        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/c0e974/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-01T11:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Note that if Nightmist has her medallion in play before playing Mist Form, she can stil discard at the end of her turn to heal.  Nothing about Mist Form prevents that.  This is usually huge because it permits Nightmist to heal up before returning to normal form and re-entering the fight.</p>",
